PR #42 UI-evidence run log, 2026-10-13 (cvmini, worktree lane4-df7-fix-pr-42-nc-new-chat-withou)

Setup
- Fixture server (real server, fixture data):
  cd apps/server && go run -tags sqlite_fts5,verifyfixture ./cmd/server --verify-fixture \
    --data "$WT/.build/ncproof/server-data" --no-mdns        -> 127.0.0.1:22507
- Controllable proxy in front of it (proxy.py, committed here):
  python3 .build/ncproof/proxy.py 127.0.0.1:22508 127.0.0.1:22507 "$WT/.build/ncproof/control"
  mode file: pass | stall (hold N s, then 500) | fail (0.3 s, then 500); POST /threads and /agents only.
- App appearance is driven through the server: PATCH /settings {"appearance":"light"|"dark"}.

macOS (real app window, Release)
- Build: xcodebuild build -project apps/Polymux/Polymux.xcodeproj -scheme Polymux \
    -configuration Release -destination platform=macOS -derivedDataPath .build/DD-macrel ...  -> BUILD SUCCEEDED
  (python3 scripts/fetch_cua.py staged the bundled runtime first)
- Launch: defaults write com.flarehq.polymux.app serverAddress http://127.0.0.1:22508; open <Release .app>
- Driven with cua-driver AX clicks on the real window; captures via get_window_state screenshot_out_file.
  22:13:01 light idle          New Chat panel, no recipients
  22:39:30 light optimistic    Create tapped with mode=stall hold=20; row captured 22:39:32; the POST
                               entered the proxy at 22:39:31 and answered 500 at 22:39:51 -> the row is
                               visible ~19 s before the server responds
  22:40:54 light notice        Create tapped with mode=fail; 500 at 22:40:54, capture 22:40:56: row
                               rolled back, notice in the sidebar inset and in the detail
  22:13:19 light error         "+" (create agent) tapped with mode=fail: 500 at 22:13:20, panel error
                               "Couldn't create this agent..." at 22:13:21
  Same four flows in dark (appearance=dark): optimistic 22:14:16 (stall, 500 at 22:15:02),
  notice 22:17:56, error 22:18:19.
- Signpost trace: /usr/bin/log show --last 40m --signpost --style json \
    --predicate 'subsystem == "com.flarehq.polymux.app" AND process == "Polymux"' > signposts-mac.json
  tap-trace-mac.txt pairs the begin/end intervals; processImagePath in the raw log is
  .build/DD-macrel/Build/Products/Release/Polymux.app/Contents/MacOS/Polymux (Release build).

iOS (booted simulator, no Simulator.app on this host)
- Build: xcodebuild build ... -destination "id=$SIM_UDID" -configuration Release \
    -derivedDataPath .build/DD-iosrel ... -> BUILD SUCCEEDED
  The built app was also installed and launched against the proxy for the live list screenshot.
- The check harness (NewChatCheck.swift, committed here) compiles the real app views and stores
  with -D DICTATION_CHECK against a release PolymuxKit and runs inside the simulator:
  xcrun --sdk iphonesimulator swiftc -O -swift-version 6 -parse-as-library -D DICTATION_CHECK \
    -target arm64-apple-ios27.0-simulator <app sources minus PolymuxApp.swift> NewChatCheck.swift \
    PolymuxKit.o AvatarKit.o PolymuxControl.o -o .build/ios-nccheck/newchatcheck-ios
  xcrun simctl spawn $SIM_UDID .build/ios-nccheck/newchatcheck-ios "$PWD/.proof/pr42-nc-20261013" "$PWD"
  run-ios-check.sh reproduces the build+run.
- Flows and captures (mtime of each PNG):
  22:36:13 ios-light-idle         New Chat panel idle
  22:36:14 ios-light-optimistic   POST /threads entered the proxy 22:36:14, answered 500 at 22:36:28;
                                  the harness asserted the local row was present and unresolved at capture
  22:36:29 ios-light-notice       after the 500, before the 8 s notice expiry
  22:36:31 ios-light-error        failed agent create (proxy 500 at 22:36:29-31), panel shows the error
  22:36:40 ios-dark-idle / 22:36:41 ios-dark-optimistic (500 at 22:36:55) /
  22:36:55 ios-dark-notice / 22:36:57 ios-dark-error
- Signpost trace: xcrun simctl spawn $SIM_UDID log show --last 9m --signpost --style json \
    --predicate 'subsystem == "com.flarehq.polymux.app"' (the simulator keeps its own log store on
  this OS). tap-trace-ios.txt pairs the intervals of the run at 22:36; the process is
  newchatcheck-ios, processImagePath .build/ios-nccheck/newchatcheck-ios (release PolymuxKit).

Proxy ordering evidence (proxy.log excerpt)
  22:36:14 POST /threads stall hold=14.0s        <- iOS light optimistic capture at 22:36:14
  22:36:28 POST /threads stall -> 500 after 14.04s
  22:39:31 POST /threads stall hold=20.0s        <- macOS light optimistic capture at 22:39:32
  22:39:51 POST /threads stall -> 500 after 20.02s
  22:40:54 POST /threads fail -> 500 after 0.32s <- macOS light notice capture at 22:40:56

Known limits (also in summary.md)
- The iOS sidebar scene renders ShellView's rows and notice inset without NavigationSplitView,
  because a split view asserts when rendered outside an app bundle in this harness.
- iOS has no Simulator UI on this host and this checkout has no XCUITest target, so the iOS states
  come from the real views and stores driven in the harness rather than from taps.
